# Services Engineer

- File I/O only via FileService (encoding, BOM, EOL)
- Session + recovery must round-trip dirty/untitled buffers safely
- LSP and AI are optional — fail soft, never block the editor
- Disk search/replace must honor excludes and large-file policy
- Prefer unit tests in `x-pad.Tests` for pure service logic
- Log unexpected failures; do not crash the process
